# Two Game Boy Colors play Tetris DX against each other over the link cable,
# with their infrared ports in view of each other. Each enters a player
# name, both choose 2PLAYER on the title screen and go through the menus,
# console 0 pressing START first; then each moves its own pieces. In the
# game the cable is pulled and plugged back in, then the infrared ports are
# turned away from each other and back, then console 1 is reset.
console 0 core=gambatte rom=tetrisdx
console 1 core=gambatte rom=tetrisdx
option 0 gambatte_gb_hwmode GBC
option 1 gambatte_gb_hwmode GBC
option 0 gambatte_gb_link_mode Link Cable
option 1 gambatte_gb_link_mode Link Cable
option 0 gambatte_gb_bootloader disabled
option 1 gambatte_gb_bootloader disabled
input 0 0 tetris_gbc_c0.inp
input 1 0 tetris_gbc_c1.inp
0 cable 0:0 1:0
0 cable 0:1 1:1
1090 checkpoint menu
1492 save mid
1492 checkpoint in_flight
1560 checkpoint game
1590 uncable 0:0
1650 cable 0:0 1:0
1680 uncable 0:1
1740 cable 0:1 1:1
1770 reset 1
1890 end
